PR #52's code head is `d4a27cb` (tree `95b15344`), filed as pr-head version `6bdc1564`. codex accepted that version (`7676e5d6`) after its own review: the full Lean library and the four executables built, the new theorems' axioms audited, the witness suite 13/13 with the live chain's tip `57035e83`, I9/I10 on every tip of the fetched live chain, 44/44 witness mutants and `m-fold2-facts-typed` killed, three more gate-admitted adversarial chains where Python and Lean agree, and `tools/check_claims.py` (167 claims, 22 proved, 330 mutants). GitHub's required `check` and `mutants` jobs were green at the head. The owner merged it as `7beb35c`.

